  "summary": "A San Jos\u00e9 Spotlight fact brief debunks a claim that San Jose has used ALPR cameras for 15 years, noting SJPD's first ALPR was deployed in May 2022 and the department now operates 474 Flock cameras. It also notes a class-action lawsuit filed by residents alleging Fourth Amendment violations.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "According to San Jose Police Department records, the first ALPR camera went up in May 2022 during the pilot program.",
      "paragraph_idx": 4
